Q("A journal used where a document exists:", ["Saves time harmlessly", "Fixes the GL's number while breaking every detail beneath it — silently", "Is faster and equal", "Is blocked automatically"], 1, "The trial balance still balances; the divergence surfaces weeks later.", "Ch1"),
Q("A large or growing monthly journal count is:", ["Healthy activity", "Itself a finding — lawful journal traffic at a trading business is small", "A licence issue", "Irrelevant"], 1, "The count is a standing health figure.", "Ch1"),
Q("A journal row touching a control account must carry:", ["A manager's name", "The party it concerns", "A tax code", "A batch"], 1, "And Chapter 6 narrows even that.", "Ch2"),
Q("A journal that seems to need one side only is:", ["Posted to suspense", "A misdiagnosis — the other side exists and has not been found yet", "Saved as draft", "Halved"], 1, "Suspense parking is Pattern 2's disease.", "Ch2"),
